## Running Tests

### Build Tests

```bash
mkdir build
cd build
cmake .. -DALPACACORE_BUILD_TESTS=ON -DALPACACORE_ENABLE_ZWO=ON
cmake --build .
```

### Run All Tests

```bash
cd build
ctest
```

### Run Specific Test Tags

```bash
# Run only ZWO camera tests
./tests/alpacacore_tests [zwo][camera]

# Run only unit tests (skip hardware tests)
./tests/alpacacore_tests [unit]

# Run integration tests
./tests/alpacacore_tests [integration]

# Exclude hardware tests
./tests/alpacacore_tests ~[hardware]
```

### Run with Verbose Output

```bash
# CTest verbose
ctest --verbose

# Catch2 verbose (list all tests)
./tests/alpacacore_tests --list-tests

# Catch2 with detailed output
./tests/alpacacore_tests --success
```

### Run Single Test Case

```bash
# Run specific test by name
./tests/alpacacore_tests "ZWO Camera Driver - Exposure Control"
```

### Test Output Options

```bash
# XML output for CI
./tests/alpacacore_tests --reporter xml > test_results.xml

# JUnit format
./tests/alpacacore_tests --reporter junit > junit.xml

# Console with colors
./tests/alpacacore_tests --reporter console
```

